0..63 Comment "//! The lowering refuses a `format` payload of the wrong shape."
64..67 Comment "//!"
68..144 Comment "//! A `format` payload is a record of the texts `latex`, `typst` and `md`. A"
145..220 Comment "//! literate render reads each text as the spelling of the declared name in"
221..292 Comment "//! one document format. A payload of another shape gives the render no"
293..306 Comment "//! spelling."
307..310 Comment "//!"
311..386 Comment "//! The lowering refuses a `format` with no payload as `MissingPayload`. It"
387..463 Comment "//! refuses a bare text, a field of no format and a field that is no text as"
464..486 Comment "//! `IllTypedPayload`."
487..490 Comment "//!"
491..507 Comment "//! - see: #6403"
509..569 Comment "// No payload: the record is the payload, and it is missing."
